        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, mix, hardwood, u=40%, at plant
refers to the actual volume of the wood (not bulked);
Synonyms: Abfallholz, Buche, Beech; 
UUID: cf50c749-3575-33d8-bf71-c6f3d3ac92cb
Mix of the different industrial residual hardwood fractions in proportion to their production in Switzerland
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Mix
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: survey 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the mix is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cf50c749-3575-33d8-bf71-c6f3d3ac92cb.xml</text>
